---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | The Tint House" description="How The Tint House collects and uses information.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><em>Last updated: November 2026</em></p>
      <!-- TODO: have the owner review. Not legal advice. -->
      <p>The Tint House ("we") respects your privacy. This policy explains what we collect through {site.url} and how we use it.</p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Information you send us through our quote form: name, phone number, what you'd like tinted, vehicle details, messages and photos.</li>
        <li>Basic, anonymous website usage data (pages viewed, device type) used to keep the site working and improve it.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to your request by phone call or text message.</li>
        <li>To prepare quotes and schedule service.</li>
        <li>With your permission, to text you about your quote. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out or HELP for help.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What we don't do</h2>
      <p>We do not sell or rent your personal information. We do not share your phone number or text messaging consent with third parties for marketing.</p>
      <h2>Service providers</h2>
      <p>We use trusted providers to host this website and deliver form submissions to us. They may process your information only to provide those services.</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask us to update or delete the information you sent us at any time. California residents may have additional rights under the California Consumer Privacy Act.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>The Tint House, {site.address.street}, {site.address.city}, {site.address.region} {site.address.zip} · <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
